<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Zunivo — the payment layer for AI agents on Arc</title>
<meta name="description" content="The payment layer for AI agents on Arc. Agents pay for APIs, data, and each other in USDC — settled on-chain in under a second. Humans get the same rails: links, names, splits." />
<meta property="og:title" content="Zunivo — the payment layer for AI agents on Arc" />
<meta property="og:description" content="The payment layer for AI agents on Arc. Machines pay for what they use, in USDC, on-chain. Humans share the same rails." />
<meta property="og:image" content="https://zunivo.io/og.png" />
<meta property="og:url" content="https://zunivo.io" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
:root{
  --paper:#F6F4EF;--paper2:#EFECE4;--ink:#101319;--ink2:#3A3F4B;--mute:#6B7180;
  --hair:#DCD8CE;--hair2:#C9C4B7;
  --indigo:#3D5AFE;--mint:#0B8F63;--mint-l:#10C48B;
  --disp:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;--body:'Inter',sans-serif;--mono:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:var(--body);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
.wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
::selection{background:var(--indigo);color:#fff}

.tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--mute)}
.tag::before{content:"{ "}.tag::after{content:" }"}
.ref{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--mute);text-transform:uppercase}

/* ---------- header ---------- */
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(246,244,239,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair)}
.hwrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.word{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:.2px}
nav.links{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink2)}
nav.links a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
nav.links a.btn{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:10px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;transition:background .15s,transform .15s}
nav.links a.btn:hover{background:var(--indigo);transform:translateY(-1px)}

/* ---------- hero ---------- */
.hero{padding:96px 0 64px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair)}
.hero .tag{display:block;margin-bottom:26px}
h1{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(46px,7vw,92px);line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-.03em}
h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--indigo)}
.hero .sub{margin:30px 0 38px;font-size:clamp(16px,1.5vw,19px);color:var(--ink2);max-width:640px}
.hero .sub b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.cta{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-block;font-weight:600;font-size:15.5px;padding:14px 30px;border-radius:999px;transition:transform .15s,background .15s,color .15s,border-color .15s}
.btn.primary{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
.btn.primary:hover{background:var(--indigo);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn.ghost{border:1.5px solid var(--ink);color:var(--ink)}
.btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--indigo);color:var(--indigo)}
.hero-note{margin-top:26px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--mute)}
.hero-note a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}

/* blueprint payment diagram */
.diagram{margin-top:72px;border:1px solid var(--hair2);border-radius:18px;background:#FBFAF7;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.diagram .ref{position:absolute;top:16px;left:20px}
.diagram .ref-r{position:absolute;top:16px;right:20px}
.diagram svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
.dot-travel{offset-path:path('M 90 150 L 380 150 L 380 150 L 700 150 L 1010 150');animation:travel 3.4s cubic-bezier(.5,.05,.4,1) infinite}
@keyframes travel{0%{offset-distance:0%;opacity:0}5%{opacity:1}88%{opacity:1}94%{offset-distance:100%;opacity:0}100%{offset-distance:100%;opacity:0}}
.settle-flash{animation:flash 3.4s ease infinite}
@keyframes flash{0%,88%{opacity:.35}93%{opacity:1}100%{opacity:.35}}
.pulse-ring{transform-origin:1010px 150px;animation:ring 3.4s ease-out infinite}
@keyframes ring{0%,88%{opacity:0;transform:scale(.4)}92%{opacity:.8;transform:scale(.8)}100%{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.6)}}

/* ---------- stats ---------- */
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair)}
.stat{padding:44px 28px;border-right:1px solid var(--hair)}
.stat:last-child{border-right:0}
.stat .n{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,3.6vw,52px);letter-spacing:-.02em}
.stat .n i{font-style:normal;color:var(--mint)}
.stat p{margin-top:8px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--mute)}

/* ---------- sections ---------- */
section{padding:110px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair)}
h2{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px);letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.06;margin:18px 0 20px}
.lead{color:var(--ink2);font-size:17.5px;max-width:700px}

/* verbs — editorial rows */
.verbs{margin-top:64px;border-top:1px solid var(--hair2)}
.verb{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 1.4fr auto;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:34px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair2);transition:background .15s}
.verb:hover{background:#FBFAF7}
.verb .no{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--mute)}
.verb h3{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px);letter-spacing:-.02em}
.verb p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink2)}
.verb .more{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--ink);border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:2px}
.verb:hover .more{color:var(--indigo);border-color:var(--indigo)}

/* machine — dark contrast block */
#machine .term{margin-top:56px;background:var(--ink);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;color:#DCE2F2}
.term-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.term-bar .ref{color:#7C8496}
.term-bar em{margin-left:auto;font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#7C8496}
.term-body{padding:26px 30px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13.5px;line-height:2.15;min-height:230px}
.term-body .c-cmd{color:#8A93A8}.term-body .c-warn{color:#E8A23D}.term-body .c-ok{color:#10C48B}.term-body .c-id{color:#8FA2FF}
.cursor{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:16px;background:#10C48B;vertical-align:-2px;animation:blink 1s steps(1) infinite}
@keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}
#machine .after{margin-top:26px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink2);max-width:700px}

/* names */
.names-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:64px;align-items:center}
.nftframe{border:1px solid var(--hair2);border-radius:18px;background:#FBFAF7;padding:34px;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative}
.nftframe .ref{position:absolute;top:14px;left:18px}
.nftframe .ref-r{position:absolute;top:14px;right:18px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--mute)}

/* trust — registry table */
.registry{margin-top:56px;border:1px solid var(--hair2);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#FBFAF7}
.rrowc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr auto;gap:20px;align-items:center;padding:22px 26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair2);font-size:15px;transition:background .15s}
.rrowc:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.rrowc:hover{background:var(--paper)}
.rrowc .ref b{color:var(--mint);font-weight:600}
.rrowc .mono{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2)}
.rrowc .mono:hover{color:var(--indigo)}
.trust-note{margin-top:22px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink2)}
.trust-note a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.trust-note a:hover{color:var(--indigo)}

/* faq */
details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair2);padding:24px 4px}
details:first-of-type{border-top:1px solid var(--hair2);margin-top:48px}
summary{cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:600;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.01em;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
summary::after{content:"+";font-family:var(--mono);font-size:20px;color:var(--mute)}
details[open] summary::after{content:"−"}
details p{margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink2);max-width:760px}

/* cta */
.cta-final{padding:130px 0;text-align:center;border-bottom:0}
.cta-final h2{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,64px)}
.cta-final p{color:var(--ink2);max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 36px}

/* footer */
footer{background:var(--ink);color:#B9BFCC;padding:64px 0 56px;font-size:14px}
.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:40px}
.fcol h4{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#7C8496;text-transform:lowercase;margin-bottom:16px}
.fcol h4::before{content:"//"}
.fcol a{display:block;margin-bottom:10px;color:#DCE2F2}
.fcol a:hover{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.fbrand p{margin-top:14px;font-size:12.5px;color:#7C8496;max-width:280px}
.fbot{margin-top:48px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:#7C8496;display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}


/* ---------- fluid layer (arc-style drifting blur blobs) ---------- */
.fluid{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(90px);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;will-change:transform}
.f-indigo{background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #C3CDFF 0%, rgba(61,90,254,.34) 55%, transparent 72%)}
.f-mint{background:radial-gradient(circle at 40% 40%, #C2F5E3 0%, rgba(16,196,139,.30) 55%, transparent 72%)}
.f-peach{background:radial-gradient(circle at 40% 40%, #FFE3CF 0%, rgba(255,166,102,.28) 55%, transparent 72%)}
@keyframes driftA{0%{transform:translate(0,0) scale(1)}50%{transform:translate(70px,-50px) scale(1.18)}100%{transform:translate(-30px,30px) scale(.95)}}
@keyframes driftB{0%{transform:translate(0,0) scale(1.1)}50%{transform:translate(-80px,40px) scale(.9)}100%{transform:translate(40px,-30px) scale(1.2)}}
@keyframes driftC{0%{transform:translate(0,0) scale(.95)}50%{transform:translate(50px,60px) scale(1.15)}100%{transform:translate(-60px,-20px) scale(1)}}
.fluid.a{animation:driftA 26s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
.fluid.b{animation:driftB 34s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
.fluid.c{animation:driftC 30s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
.hero,.stats,section,.cta-final{position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero .wrap,section .wrap,.stats .stat{position:relative;z-index:1}
.diagram{background:rgba(251,250,247,.75);backdrop-filter:blur(2px)}
.nftframe{background:rgba(251,250,247,.7);backdrop-filter:blur(2px)}
.registry{background:rgba(251,250,247,.75);backdrop-filter:blur(2px)}

/* reveal */
.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}

@media (max-width:960px){
  .stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .stat:nth-child(2){border-right:0}
  .stat{border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair)}
  .verb{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;padding:26px 4px}
  .names-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:44px}
  .fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}
@media (max-width:600px){
  .hero{padding-top:64px}
  nav.links a:not(.btn){display:none}
  .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .stat{border-right:0}
  .rrowc{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
  *,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
  .rv{opacity:1;transform:none}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="hwrap">
    <svg width="28" height="21" viewBox="0 0 152 112" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="20" y="20" width="72" height="14" rx="7" fill="#3D5AFE"/><line x1="82" y1="41" x2="30" y2="81" stroke="#10C48B" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="30" cy="81" r="5" fill="#0B8F63"/><rect x="20" y="88" width="72" height="14" rx="7" fill="#3D5AFE"/></svg>
    <span class="word">zunivo</span>
    <nav class="links">
      <a href="#verbs">Product</a>
      <a href="#machine">Machines</a>
      <a href="#names">Names</a>
      <a href="#trust">Trust</a>
      <a href="https://docs.zunivo.io" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Docs</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/zunivo-pay" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://app.zunivo.io/">Launch app</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="fluid f-indigo a" style="width:620px;height:620px;top:-180px;right:-140px"></div>
  <div class="fluid f-mint b" style="width:480px;height:480px;top:220px;right:280px;opacity:.8"></div>
  <div class="fluid f-peach c" style="width:520px;height:520px;bottom:-220px;left:-160px"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="tag">zunivo · the payment layer for ai agents on arc</span>
    <h1>AI agents can think.<br />Now they can <em>pay.</em></h1>
    <p class="sub">Every payment rail on earth assumes a human clicking "confirm." Zunivo doesn't.
      On Arc, an <b>AI agent</b> discovers a service, pays for it in USDC, and gets a receipt —
      no card, no human, one function call. And the same rails work beautifully for people:
      payment links, <b>.agent</b> names, committed sends, atomic splits. Non-custodial by construction.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn primary" href="https://github.com/zunivo-pay">See an agent pay (402)</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="https://app.zunivo.io/">Try the human side</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-note">live on arc testnet · four verified contracts · <a href="https://github.com/zunivo-pay" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">open source ↗</a></p>

    <!-- blueprint payment diagram -->
    <div class="diagram rv">
      <span class="ref">zunivo.runtime | payment_path</span>
      <span class="ref ref-r settle-flash" style="color:var(--mint)">settled · 0.4s</span>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1100 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="A payment travelling from payer through the order-bound rail to arc.agent">
        <line x1="90" y1="150" x2="1010" y2="150" stroke="#C9C4B7" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="1 6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <!-- payer -->
        <g>
          <circle cx="90" cy="150" r="30" fill="#F6F4EF" stroke="#101319" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <text x="90" y="155" text-anchor="middle" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" font-size="12" fill="#3A3F4B">0xF5…</text>
          <text x="90" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2" fill="#6B7180">PAYER</text>
        </g>
        <!-- order node -->
        <g>
          <rect x="340" y="110" width="80" height="80" rx="14" fill="#F6F4EF" stroke="#3D5AFE" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <rect x="362" y="130" width="36" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="#3D5AFE"/>
          <line x1="392" y1="142" x2="368" y2="160" stroke="#10C48B" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <rect x="362" y="164" width="36" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="#3D5AFE"/>
          <text x="380" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2" fill="#6B7180">ORDER-BOUND RAIL</text>
        </g>
        <!-- receipt node -->
        <g>
          <rect x="620" y="118" width="160" height="64" rx="12" fill="#F6F4EF" stroke="#101319" stroke-width="1.2"/>
          <text x="638" y="145" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" font-size="11" fill="#6B7180">amount</text>
          <text x="762" y="145" text-anchor="end" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" font-size="11" fill="#101319">120.00 USDC</text>
          <line x1="638" y1="155" x2="762" y2="155" stroke="#DCD8CE" stroke-width="1"/>
          <text x="638" y="172" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" font-size="11" fill="#6B7180">receipt</text>
          <text x="762" y="172" text-anchor="end" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" font-size="11" fill="#0B8F63">on-chain ✓</text>
          <text x="700" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2" fill="#6B7180">AUDIT TRAIL</text>
        </g>
        <!-- recipient -->
        <g class="settle-flash">
          <rect x="950" y="110" width="120" height="80" rx="14" fill="#101319"/>
          <text x="968" y="146" font-family="Space Grotesk,sans-serif" font-weight="700" font-size="24" fill="#F6F4EF">arc</text>
          <text x="968" y="166" font-family="Space Grotesk,sans-serif" font-weight="600" font-size="13" fill="#10C48B">.agent</text>
          <text x="1010" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" font-size="11" letter-spacing="2" fill="#6B7180">RECIPIENT</text>
        </g>
        <circle class="pulse-ring" cx="1010" cy="150" r="36" fill="none" stroke="#10C48B" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      </svg>
      <!-- travelling coin -->
      <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 1100 300" style="width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible">
          <g class="dot-travel">
            <circle r="12" fill="#10C48B"/>
            <text y="4" text-anchor="middle" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" font-weight="600" font-size="11" fill="#F6F4EF">$</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- STATS -->
<div class="stats">
  <div class="stat rv"><div class="n">0.4<i>s</i></div><p>{ median settlement, deterministic }</p></div>
  <div class="stat rv"><div class="n">4</div><p>{ verified zero-custody contracts }</p></div>
  <div class="stat rv"><div class="n">≤1<i>%</i></div><p>{ protocol fee, hard-capped in code }</p></div>
  <div class="stat rv"><div class="n">0</div><p>{ custody — atomic payer → recipient }</p></div>
</div>

<!-- MACHINE -->
<section id="machine">
  <div class="fluid f-mint a" style="width:640px;height:640px;bottom:-200px;left:-180px"></div>
  <div class="fluid f-indigo c" style="width:520px;height:520px;top:-120px;right:-160px;opacity:.75"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="tag rv">the core · machine payments</span>
    <h2 class="rv">The first payment rail<br />built for machines</h2>
    <p class="lead rv">Cards need a cardholder. Bank rails need a person. None of them can serve the millions of
      AI agents now calling paid APIs, metering usage by request, and trading services with each other.
      Zunivo is built for exactly this: an agent hits a priced endpoint, pays in USDC over HTTP 402,
      and retries with proof — discover, pay, consume, all autonomous. Three lines of code turn any API into
      something a machine can pay for. Every call leaves a settled, auditable on-chain receipt.</p>
    <div class="term rv">
      <div class="term-bar"><span class="ref">zunivo.runtime | ref-402</span><em>agent · arc testnet</em></div>
      <div class="term-body" id="termBody"><span class="cursor"></span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="after rv">Every line above is a real flow running on Arc Testnet today — an autonomous agent
      discovering a price, paying from its own wallet, collecting an auditable receipt.
      No card networks. No human in the loop.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- VERBS -->
<section id="verbs">
  <div class="fluid f-peach b" style="width:560px;height:560px;top:-140px;right:-200px;opacity:.7"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="tag rv">the human side · one network, four verbs</span>
    <h2 class="rv">And humans get<br />the same rails</h2>
    <p class="lead rv">Each verb is its own verified contract — small enough to read, strong enough to promise.</p>
    <div class="verbs rv">
      <a class="verb" href="https://app.zunivo.io/">
        <span class="no">//01</span>
        <h3>Get paid</h3>
        <p>Links, QR codes, machine-issued invoices. Any wallet pays — or no wallet at all, with a passkey and Face ID.</p>
        <span class="more">Create a link</span>
      </a>
      <a class="verb" href="https://app.zunivo.io/send">
        <span class="no">//02</span>
        <h3>Send</h3>
        <p>Pay anyone by name or address, settled in under a second, with a receipt both sides keep.</p>
        <span class="more">Send now</span>
      </a>
      <a class="verb" href="https://app.zunivo.io/send">
        <span class="no">//03</span>
        <h3>Commit</h3>
        <p>Payroll-grade scheduled sends: locked on-chain until a date, irrevocable once made. The recipient watches the countdown — not even Zunivo can touch it.</p>
        <span class="more">Schedule</span>
      </a>
      <a class="verb" href="https://app.zunivo.io/">
        <span class="no">//04</span>
        <h3>Split</h3>
        <p>One payment, divided atomically between up to 20 recipients on immutable terms. Everyone gets their cut and their receipt.</p>
